      {%- comment -%} How to Measure {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="neon-card bg-bekky-purple-neon/10 border-2 border-bekky-purple-neon">
        <h2 class="text-bekky-gold-neon text-2xl sm:text-3xl mb-6 font-heading">How to Measure</h2>
        
        <div class="space-y-4 text-bekky-gray-light">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-bekky-purple-neon text-lg mb-2 font-heading">Chest</h3>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              Measure around the fullest part of your chest, keeping the tape measure horizontal and snug but not tight. For the most accurate measurement, wear a well-fitting t-shirt.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-bekky-purple-neon text-lg mb-2 font-heading">Length</h3>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              Measure from the top of the shoulder (where the shoulder seam would be) down to the desired length. For t-shirts, this is typically to the hip. For hoodies and jerseys, it may be longer.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-bekky-purple-neon text-lg mb-2 font-heading">Sleeve Length</h3>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              Measure from the center back of the neck, across the shoulder, and down to the wrist. Keep your arm slightly bent for a more natural fit.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} Fit Tips {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="neon-card">
        <h2 class="text-bekky-purple-neon text-2xl sm:text-3xl mb-6 font-heading">Fit Tips</h2>
        
        <ul class="list-disc ml-6 space-y-3 text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed">
          <li><strong>When in doubt, size up.</strong> Our products are designed for comfort, and a slightly looser fit is often more comfortable for festival wear.</li>
          <li><strong>Consider layering.</strong> If you plan to wear items over other clothing, consider sizing up for a more comfortable fit.</li>
          <li><strong>Check product-specific notes.</strong> Some items may have unique sizing characteristics mentioned on the product page.</li>
          <li><strong>All measurements are approximate.</strong> Slight variations may occur due to manufacturing processes.</li>
          <li><strong>Need help?</strong> Contact us at <a href="mailto:BigButtAssociation@gmail.com" class="neon-text-purple hover:text-bekky-gold-neon transition-colors">BigButtAssociation@gmail.com</a> if you're unsure about sizing.</li>
        </ul>
